{"ref":"powerup:fever","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Fever.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Fever is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It increases the duration of ",{"i":"Sprite-Gilded_Clover.png","w":24,"h":24}," Gold Fever and ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Finger.png","w":24,"h":24}," Gold Finger."]}],"infobox":[],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Fever multiplies the duration of Gold Fever and Gold Finger, making them last longer and potentially achieve a higher coin count or better rewards respectively."]},{"k":"p","c":["Note that this multiplier is separate from the Gold Fever cap and duration bonus of ",{"i":"Sprite-Big_Trouser.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:big-trouser"}," ",{"t":"Big Trouser","r":"character:big-trouser"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Sammy.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:sammy"}," ",{"t":"Sammy","r":"character:sammy"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-TidesOfTheFoscari.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access"},"."]},{"k":"h","c":["PowerUp"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Fever"],"h":1,"cs":20}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"PowerUp-Fever.png","w":128,"h":128},"Increases duration of Gold Fever and Gold Finger by 5% per rank (max +25%)."],"cs":20}]},{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["PowerUp"],"h":1,"cs":20}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Release"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Fever?action=edit"}],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["ID"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Fever?action=edit"}],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Max level"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":["5"],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Bonus per level"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":["+5%"],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Stacking"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":["Additive"],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Max effect"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":["+25%"],"cs":12}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Initial cost"],"h":1,"cs":8},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 50,000"],"cs":12}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["The Fever PowerUp increases Gold Fever and Gold Finger duration by 5% per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, the duration is increased by 25%. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 50,000, and is unlocked by collecting ",{"i":"Sprite-Antipyretic.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:antipyretic"}," ",{"t":"Antipyretic","r":"relic:antipyretic"}," in ",{"t":"Biggus Discus","r":"stage:biggus-discus"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Fever"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+5%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+15%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+25%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From Items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Fever's associated passive item is ",{"i":"Sprite-Karoma's_Mana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"}," ",{"t":"Karoma's Mana","r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"},", which provides +10% Fever per level, up to a total of +50% Fever at level 5."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-survarot","title":"From Survarot","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Survarocchi.png","w":24,"h":24}," FOIL Skill: Overhealing by +16 provides +1% Fever."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game, with the introduction of ",{"t":"Karoma's Mana","r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"},"."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fever, ",{"i":"Sprite-Defang.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:defang"}," ",{"t":"Defang","r":"powerup:defang"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Preserve.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:preserve"}," ",{"t":"Preserve","r":"powerup:preserve"},", Invulnerability Time, and Thorns are the only character stats in the game that are not displayed on the stat panel."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fever, Invulnerability Time, and Thorns are the only stats without a respective PowerUp."]}]}},{"c":["Fever was accidentally leaked as a stat in all languages besides English for the erroneous description of ",{"i":"Sprite-Brave_Story.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:brave-story"}," ",{"t":"Brave Story","r":"relic:brave-story"},", displaying the description of the relic that unlocks it as a PowerUp."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}